OL,3,GNEWSA6,750 homes planned in city centre
OL,4,Aregeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA masterplan to revamp Wolverhampton
OL,7,Fcity centre has been approved.
OL,9,FAs part of the Our Future City Centre
OL,10,FPlan, 6,750 new homes could be built in
OL,11,Fa bid to create a more "vibrant,
OL,12,Finclusive, connected and resilient city
OL,13,Fcentre", the council said.
OL,15,FPlanners have highlighted 33 potential
OL,16,Fsites across 10 areas for regeneration
OL,17,Fto create spaces for employment,
OL,18,Fleisure, culture and community
OL,19,Ffacilities.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
